# WireGuard (official build, versionName 1.0.20260315; #159 Slice 1, DIA-20260721-05) -- NOT on the main F-Droid
# repo, so it is COMMITTED in-repo as core/vendor-common/prebuilts/WireGuard.apk (un-ignored in .gitignore).
# Both stage-vendor.sh scripts copy every git-tracked prebuilts/*.apk into the staged tree after their rsync, and
# fetch-default-apps.sh then skips it, sha matched. Its native libs are stored uncompressed, so it needs no JNI
# extraction. To move the pin, replace the committed APK and update this row's VersionCode and SHA256 together;
# test-prebuilt-pins.sh fails while the row and the tracked blob disagree.
WireGuard     com.wireguard.android    519       f92971bc804f4c448e8845ae97e426095eab06ec09a2473a3fa2cfe7288e3298 manual
